  <section class="section"><div class="shell content-grid"><article><h2>Starting point</h2><p>Explain the person’s previous professional context and the opportunity or challenge they were exploring.</p></article><article><h2>Development experience</h2><p>Describe the training, mentorship, responsibilities, and work completed.</p></article><article><h2>Verified progress</h2><p>Share only outcomes that can be substantiated and that the contributor has approved for publication.</p></article></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
